        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Flossie Bailey, Madam C. J. Walker\n- Organizations: NAACP\n- Awards: Madam C. J. Walker Medal\n- Topics: African American entrepreneurship, business success\n\nFacts:\n- Flossie Bailey was a recipient of the national NAACP's Madam C. J. Walker Medal.\n- Madam C. J. Walker was eulogized as the first female self-made millionaire in America.\n- Madam C. J. Walker became one of the wealthiest African American women in the United States.\n- Madam C. J. Walker was described as the world's most successful female entrepreneur of her time.\n- Madam C. J. Walker was one of the most successful African-American business owners ever.",
